<section class="bg-shade mi-4 rounded-lg" style="padding: 6rem 0;">
    <div class="container flex gap-8 justify-center">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
            <p class="text-lg mt-4" style="max-inline-size: 60dvh;">
                "As a community builder myself, I created Trellixe to solve a problem I faced every day: meeting wonderful people but failing to follow up. I wanted a tool that was simple, focused, and helped me be the intentional connector I aspired to be. I'd love for you to try it and tell me what you think." 
